OL,3,GNEWSA'Displaced' mirror was factor in
OL,4,Afatal crash, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist killed in a crash in the
OL,7,Fwest of the Isle of Man could not have
OL,8,Fstopped in time to avoid a Jeep because
OL,9,Fof his speed, an inquest has heard.
OL,11,FGareth Jack Underwood, 37, was riding
OL,12,Fhome to Ramsey via Kirk Michael on 15
OL,13,FApril when his Honda collided with the
OL,14,FJeep. He suffered lacerations as well
OL,15,Fas chest and rib injuries.
OL,17,FRecording a verdict of accidental death
OL,18,Fat Douglas Courthouse, coroner James
OL,19,FBrooks offered his condolences to
OL,20,FUnderwood's family.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,448,445,260,140,0,100
