OL,3,GNEWSA'Displaced' mirror was factor in
OL,4,Afatal crash, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FPC Richard Goldie said a fixed mirror
OL,7,Fat the crossroads, which helped drivers
OL,8,Fwith limited visibility, had been
OL,9,F"displaced", so the Jeep's driver and
OL,10,Fpassenger could not have seen the bike
OL,11,Fapproaching from further away.
